<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Survei Kerja Sama Berhasil Dikirim — SUKAFTI FTI Universitas Andalas." />
  <title><%= title %></title>

  <!-- Lucide Icons -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
  <!-- Basecoat UI -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/basecoat-css@latest/dist/basecoat.min.css" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --slate-50: #f8fafc;
      --slate-100: #f1f5f9;
      --slate-200: #e2e8f0;
      --slate-300: #cbd5e1;
      --slate-400: #94a3b8;
      --slate-600: #475569;
      --slate-700: #334155;
      --slate-800: #1e293b;
      --slate-900: #0f172a;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--slate-50);
      color: var(--slate-900);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .success-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .success-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #d1fae5;
      color: #065f46;
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 4px solid #a7f3d0;
    }

    .success-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--slate-900);
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .success-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    }

    /* Receipt Card */
    .receipt-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px dashed var(--slate-300);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: left;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Receipt jagged details at top/bottom (decoration) */
    .receipt-card::before, .receipt-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background-size: 8px 4px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    
    .receipt-card::before {
      top: -4px;
      background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, white 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(225deg, white 25%, transparent 25%);
    }

    .receipt-card__header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .receipt-card__brand {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--slate-900);
    }

    .receipt-card__status {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: var(--slate-800);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .receipt-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .receipt-label {
      color: var(--slate-400);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .receipt-val {
      color: var(--slate-800);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: right;
      max-width: 250px;
    }

    .receipt-val--highlight {
      color: var(--slate-900);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .receipt-footer {
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--slate-200);
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .btn-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary-action {
      background: var(--slate-900);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn-primary-action:hover {
      background: var(--slate-800);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-secondary-action {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-300);
      color: var(--slate-700);
    }

    .btn-secondary-action:hover {
      background: var(--slate-50);
      color: var(--slate-900);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="success-container">
    
    <!-- ① SUCCESS INDICATOR -->
    <div class="success-badge">
      <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" style="width:32px; height:32px;"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="success-title">Terima Kasih!</h1>
    <p class="success-desc">Kuesioner evaluasi survei kerja sama Anda telah berhasil disimpan di server SUKAFTI.</p>

    <!-- ② RECEIPT CARD -->
    <article class="receipt-card">
      <div class="receipt-card__header">
        <span class="receipt-card__brand">BUKTI PENGISIAN SURVEI</span>
        <span class="receipt-card__status">SELESAI</span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-row">
        <span class="receipt-label">ID Respon</span>
        <span class="receipt-val">#RSP-<%= response.id.toString().padStart(5, '0') %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-row">
        <span class="receipt-label">Mitra Industri</span>
        <span class="receipt-val"><%= response.partner_name %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-row">
        <span class="receipt-label">Judul Survei</span>
        <span class="receipt-val"><%= response.survey_title %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-row">
        <span class="receipt-label">Tanggal Submit</span>
        <span class="receipt-val">
          <% const dateObj = new Date(response.submitted_at); %>
          <%= dateObj.toLocaleDateString('id-ID', { day: '2-digit', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %> 
          <%= dateObj.toLocaleTimeString('id-ID', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }) %>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-footer">
        Bukti digital ini dihasilkan secara otomatis oleh sistem informasi kerja sama FTI Universitas Andalas sebagai tanda terima resmi.
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ③ ACTION BUTTONS -->
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
      <a href="/logout" class="btn-action btn-primary-action">
        <i data-lucide="log-out"></i> Keluar dari Sistem
      </a>
      <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-action btn-secondary-action">
        <i data-lucide="printer"></i> Cetak Bukti Pengisian (PDF)
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    // ── Lucide Icons ───────────────────────────────────────
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
